  "description": "ASP.NET Core host for a Rask WebAssembly app written in C#, or any other built single-page app. `app.MapRaskSpa()` serves the build output with correct MIME types, cache headers that follow what the build guarantees, precompressed siblings and a SPA fallback that still 404s a missing asset. A referenced WebAssembly client is published by the build and served with hot reload under `rask dev`. Depends on nothing else in Rask.",
